            "detailed_description": "At first sight, Cubot is a puzzle-game with a <strong>minimalist gameplay</strong>, just move color cubes towards tiles of the same color. It's really easy, but it will be <strong>a torture for your mind</strong> to complete all levels of the game because the apparent simplicity of the game is in contradiction with the complexity of the level-design. Moreover, an important point in the gameplay is if you have multiple cubes, they move <strong>simultaneously</strong> !<br><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Easy gameplay</strong>, just move cubes... that's it!<br></li><li><strong>Simplistic but not repetitive</strong>, use different elements to achieve your goal: buttons, elevators, color swappers, teleporters...<br></li><li>The game and menus have a <strong>clean look</strong> to not disturb your concentration. In the same vein, the music is very soothing.<br></li><li>There are <strong>80 levels</strong> for several hours of playing to keep you challenged.<br></li><li>The <strong>challenge increases level by level</strong>. If you are stumped, help is available!</li></ul>",
